      "writtenOn": "2022-06-09T09:55:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry about the lengthy comment, I think in short, we just need to double check if we are currently advertising a connectable advertisement before disconnecting. \n\nIf we are, we should allow the connection to go through since connectable advertisement allows incoming connections.",
